{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":101,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܒܘܼܬ ܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܘܕܝܼܘܵܢ ܒܸܬ ܙܵܡܪܹܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܒܸܬ ܫܲܒܚܸܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܐܵܙܹܠ݇ܢ ܒܗܵܘܢܵܐ ܒܐܘܼܪܚܵܐ ܬܲܡܝܼܡܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܒܸܬ ܐܵܬܹܝܬ ܠܟܸܣܠܝܼ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܚܵܕܪܹܢ ܒܬܲܡܝܼܡܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܠܸܒܝܼ ܒܓܵܘܵܐ ܕܒܲܝܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܡܲܬܒܸܢ ܩܲܕܡ ܥܲܝܢܝܼ̈ ܡܸܢܕܝܼ ܕܥܵܘܠܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܢܹܐ ܠܝܼ ܠܥܒ݂ܵܕܵܐ ܕܩܵܠܒܵܢܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܕܵܒܹܫ ܒܝܼܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܸܒܵܐ ܦܟ̰ܝܼܠܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܥܵܒܹܪ ܡܸܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܹܐ ܝܵܕܥܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܕܡܵܚܹܐ ܕܲܠܩܘܼܒ݂ܠܔ ܕܚܲܒ݂ܪܹܗ ܒܛܸܫܘܵܐ، ܒܸܬ ܛܲܠܩܸܢ ܐܸܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܕܝܼܢܵܐ ܪ̈ܵܡܵܢܹܐ ܥܲܝܢܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܘܫܲܒ݂ܗܸܪܵܢܵܐ ܠܸܒܹܗ، ܠܹܐ ܡܵܨܹܝܢ ܛܵܥܢܹܢ ܐܸܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܝܢܝܼ̈ ܥܲܠܔ ܡܗܘܼܡܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܕܝܵܬܒ݂ܝܼ ܥܲܡܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܕܚܵܕܹܪ ܒܐܘܼܪܚܵܐ ܬܲܡܝܼܡܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܒܸܬ ܥܵܒܹܕ ܚܸܠܡܲܬ ܐܸܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܝܵܬܹܒ݂ ܒܓܵܘܵܐ ܕܒܲܝܬ‌ܝܼ ܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܦܸܠܡܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܡܙܸܡܵܢܵܐ ܕܕܘܼܓܠܹ̈ܐ ܠܹܐ ܗܵܘܹܐ ܩܸܘܝܵܐ ܩܲܕܡ ܥܲܝܢܝܼ̈.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܨܲܦܪܵܐ ܒܨܲܦܪܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܛܲܠܩܸܢ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܸܩܛܵܥܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܡܕܝܼܢ݇ܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܦܵܠܚܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܥܵܘܠܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/101.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/102.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/100.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}